OL,3,APM believes Brexit vote was legitimate
OL,4,Adespite Russia interference claims, No
OL,5,A10 says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham believes the 2016 Brexit
OL,8,Freferendum result was "legitimate",
OL,9,FDowning Street has said, after the
OL,10,Fprime minister claimed there was
OL,11,FRussian interference in the vote.
OL,13,FIt is "inconceivable" that Russia did
OL,14,Fnot try to use the referendum to its
OL,15,Fadvantage, a No 10 spokesman said, but
OL,16,Fthe PM believed it did not succeed in
OL,17,Finfluencing the result.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
