OL,3,APM believes Brexit vote was legitimate
OL,4,Adespite Russia interference claims, No
OL,5,A10 says
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham told The Rest is Politics
OL,8,Fpodcast, that upon arriving in Downing
OL,9,FStreet, he had asked if there had been
OL,10,FRussian interference in the vote,
OL,11,Fadding: "I've had the clear answer
OL,12,Fthat, yes, there was."
OL,14,FReform UK leader Nigel Farage called
OL,15,Fthe prime minister a "liar" while the
OL,16,FConservatives said he had been "at
OL,17,Fbest... carelessly vague".
